# Normalise line endings to LF in the repository.
#
# This repo has two editing paths that must agree (see CONTRIBUTING.md):
# Decap CMS commits from the browser and always writes LF, while a
# contributor editing Markdown on Windows would otherwise commit CRLF.
# Without this, the next CMS edit of that file shows up as a whole-file
# rewrite in the diff, and real changes become impossible to review.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Assets git should never try to normalise.
*.jpg   binary
*.jpeg  binary
*.png   binary
*.webp  binary
*.avif  binary
*.gif   binary
*.ico   binary
*.woff  binary
*.woff2 binary
